The '''Mage Council''' is a [[Location]] within the {{Zone|Community Center (Scarleton)}} in {{Zone|Scarleton}}. It is used for two meetings in the Mage [[Crimson Isle Main Questline]].

{{ZoneText|Where decisions are made.}}

== Quest ==
Midway through the [[Mage Faction]] [[Crimson Isle Main Questline|Questline]], {{NPCSprite|Queen Nyx}}, {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}}, {{NPCSprite|Dean}}, and three {{NPCSprite|Counsellor;Counsellors}} appear to discuss stolen research located in {{Zone|The Bastion}}.

Later on, {{NPCSprite|Captain Ahone}}, {{NPCSprite|Grelius}}, and {{NPCSprite|Krevius}} appear, discussing stolen {{Item|Sulphur}}.

